  "extensions": {
    "fontSubstitution": "BMW Type Next is a private/licensed typeface (woff2 files shipped in /fonts, family bmwTypeNextWeb). Extraction records it as-is; for any off-site rendering use system fallbacks Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial / sans-serif. No other typeface invented.",
